 "audio_url": null,
 "note_en": "不是……而是…… means \"not ... but rather ...\" and is used to correct a wrong idea: 躺平不是什么都不做，而是不再为了别人的期待硬撑 \"lying flat isn't doing nothing, but no longer forcing yourself to meet other people's expectations.\" English often just says \"it's not X, it's Y\"; in Chinese the 而是 is needed to link the two halves.",
